# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py (the repo-side check that
# the demo's copies are still the plugin's), build-wasm.sh and crosscheck/ (the
# harness that renders one schedule through this page's WebAssembly and through
# sztest and compares them); wasm/ holds the page's host glue and GL shim, which
# are compiled INTO schlieren-core.wasm, and the build's input manifest.
# wrangler would otherwise upload them and serve them, which is neither useful
# nor anybody's business.
tools/
wasm/
